    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Active process of transformation versus completed work",
     "texto": [
      "In the analysis of infrastructure:",
      "1. **Vorgangspassiv (werden + Partizip II)**: Describes that the works are under way (**Die Straße wird asphaltiert**: the road is being asphalted). It is usually accompanied by time adverbs such as **gerade, zurzeit, gegenwärtig**.",
      "2. **Zustandspassiv (sein + Partizip II)**: Confirms that the work has finished and the space is available (**Die Straße ist asphaltiert**: the road is asphalted)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Context",
